# ========================
# BOOKING REMINDERS (Scheduled Job)
# ========================
# Cron expression â€” táº§n suáº¥t cháº¡y job nháº¯c nhá»Ÿ
# Máº·c Ä‘á»‹nh: má»—i 10 phÃºt (*/10 * * * *)
REMINDER_CRON_EXPR=

# Cá»­a sá»• nháº¯c nhá»Ÿ trÆ°á»›c 1 ngÃ y: tÃ¬m booking cÃ³ scheduledAt trong khoáº£ng
